      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "The representative said the well, together with filter upgrades at a water treatment plant, would let the county resume processing the upcountry wait list.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "N5Uix8ba9zI",
        "ts": "1:57:28",
        "endTs": "1:57:58",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:06:35.375Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "He said the well would add one million gallons a day to the upcountry water system.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "N5Uix8ba9zI",
        "ts": "1:57:01",
        "endTs": "1:57:31",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:06:35.375Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "The representative said the land price is $470,000.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "N5Uix8ba9zI",
        "ts": "1:56:49",
        "endTs": "1:57:19",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:06:35.375Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "He said the purchase followed the standard process, including an independent appraisal (an outside estimate of the land's value).",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "N5Uix8ba9zI",
        "ts": "1:56:14",
        "endTs": "1:56:48",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:06:35.375Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "A department representative asked the council to act today on Resolution 26-102, a land purchase for a new upcountry well.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "N5Uix8ba9zI",
        "ts": "1:55:50",
        "endTs": "1:56:29",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:06:35.375Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "The council approved the well site purchase 9–0.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "u9uLIOvdW0o",
        "ts": "0:34:55",
        "endTs": "0:35:25",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:12:05.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "The well is expected to produce about a million gallons per day.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "u9uLIOvdW0o",
        "ts": "0:29:19",
        "endTs": "0:29:49",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:12:05.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "The department said completing the purchase lets it do geo work on the property and start the design process.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "u9uLIOvdW0o",
        "ts": "0:26:30",
        "endTs": "0:27:00",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:12:05.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "A department official said the well was drilled on Haleakalā Ranch land instead of the planned spot.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "u9uLIOvdW0o",
        "ts": "0:21:06",
        "endTs": "0:21:36",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:12:05.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
      "dateISO": "2026-06-19",
      "text": "A council member said the well will increase upcountry water and help the Department of Water Supply work through the upcountry wait list.",
      "basis": "said-at-meeting",
      "source": {
        "type": "meeting",
        "videoId": "u9uLIOvdW0o",
        "ts": "0:19:20",
        "endTs": "0:19:50",
        "retrievedISO": "2026-10-16T18:12:05.906Z"
      },
      "body": "County Council Meeting"
    },
    {
